#. translators: Heading of the admin notice shown after the plugin is switched on. Keep the bold tags around the panel's name. Verb phrase, imperative.
#: classes/Notice/ActivationNotice.php:71
msgid "Finish the ACF <b>Multilingual Setup</b>"
msgstr "Voltooi de ACF <b>meertalige configuratie</b>"

#. translators: Body of that admin notice; "Field Group" is ACF's own name for the screen.
#: classes/Notice/ActivationNotice.php:73
msgid "Before you can start translating, you need to edit each ACF Field Group to set a translation option for the fields inside it."
msgstr "Voordat u kunt beginnen met vertalen, moet u elke ACF-veldgroep bewerken om een vertaaloptie in te stellen voor de velden erin."

#. translators: The placeholders are replaced by an HTML link pointing to the documentation.
#: classes/Notice/ActivationNotice.php:76
#: classes/Notice/FieldGroupModes.php:61
#, php-format
msgid "Read more about %1$show to translate your ACF custom fields%2$s"
msgstr "Lees meer over %1$shoe u uw aangepaste ACF-velden kunt vertalen%2$s"

#. translators: The placeholders are replaced by an HTML link pointing to field groups list.
#: classes/Notice/ActivationNotice.php:83
#, php-format
msgid "%1$sSet translation options%2$s"
msgstr "%1$sVertaalopties instellen%2$s"

#. translators: Heading of the admin notice inviting the site owner to set a translation option on each field group.
#: classes/Notice/FieldGroupModes.php:56
msgid "Let's Start Translating!"
msgstr "Laten we beginnen met vertalen!"

#. translators: Body of that admin notice; "Field Group" is ACF's own name for the screen.
#: classes/Notice/FieldGroupModes.php:58
msgid "Edit each Field Group to select a translation option for the fields inside it. If you don't set a translation option, you will not be able to translate your fields."
msgstr "Bewerk elke veldgroep om een vertaaloptie te selecteren voor de velden erin. Als u geen vertaaloptie instelt, kunt u uw velden niet vertalen."

#. translators: %s is the title of the field group being saved.
#: classes/Notice/FieldNameCollisions.php:102
#, php-format
msgid "A field in \"%s\" has the same name as a field in another field group. WPML stores translation preferences by field name, so two fields that share a name cannot be set differently."
msgstr "Een veld in “%s” heeft dezelfde naam als een veld in een andere veldgroep. WPML slaat vertaalvoorkeuren op per veldnaam, dus twee velden die een naam delen kunnen niet verschillend worden ingesteld."

#. translators: %s is the title of the field group being saved.
#: classes/Notice/FieldNameCollisions.php:104
#, php-format
msgid "Some fields in \"%s\" have the same name as fields in other field groups. WPML stores translation preferences by field name, so fields that share a name cannot be set differently."
msgstr "Sommige velden in “%s” hebben dezelfde naam als velden in andere veldgroepen. WPML slaat vertaalvoorkeuren op per veldnaam, dus velden die een naam delen kunnen niet verschillend worden ingesteld."

#. translators: Heading of the admin notice about two fields in different groups sharing a name; "here" is the field group being edited.
#: classes/Notice/FieldNameCollisions.php:107
msgid "What you set here may not be what your visitors get"
msgstr "Wat u hier instelt, is mogelijk niet wat uw bezoekers te zien krijgen"

#. translators: %1$s is a field name, %2$s is the title of another field group.
#: classes/Notice/FieldNameCollisions.php:127
#, php-format
msgid "The field %1$s also exists in \"%2$s\". Rename this field to give it a translation setting of its own."
msgstr "Het veld %1$s bestaat ook in “%2$s”. Wijzig de naam van dit veld om het een eigen vertaalinstelling te geven."

#. translators: Link at the end of a line in that notice; it opens the other field group. Verb phrase, imperative.
#: classes/Notice/FieldNameCollisions.php:135
msgid "See both fields"
msgstr "Bekijk beide velden"

#. translators: Button in the admin notice about untranslated media texts; it opens WPML's Media Translation settings. Verb phrase, imperative.
#: classes/Notice/MediaTexts.php:57
msgid "Go to Media Translation settings"
msgstr "Ga naar de instellingen voor mediavertaling"

#. translators: Body of the admin notice about untranslated media texts. The quoted text is the name of a WPML setting and is translated the same way there.
#: classes/Notice/MediaTexts.php:110
msgid "This content has ACF image, gallery, or file fields, but the alt text, caption, and title of their media will not be sent for translation. To include them, turn on \"Translate Media Library texts when translating content\" in WPML Media Translation settings."
msgstr "Deze inhoud heeft ACF-afbeeldings-, galerij- of bestandsvelden, maar de alt-tekst, het bijschrift en de titel van hun media worden niet verzonden voor vertaling. Om ze op te nemen, schakel je “Media Library-teksten vertalen bij het vertalen van content” in bij de instellingen van WPML Media Translation."

#. translators: Heading of the admin notice about untranslated media texts.
#: classes/Notice/MediaTexts.php:122
msgid "Media texts are not being translated"
msgstr "Media-teksten worden niet vertaald"

#. translators: The placeholders are replaced by an HTML link pointing to the WPML Media settings page.
#: classes/Notice/MediaTexts.php:126
#, php-format
msgid "%1$sGo to Media Translation settings%2$s"
msgstr "%1$sGa naar de instellingen voor mediavertaling%2$s"

#. translators: Heading of the admin notice on an ACF options page. Keep the bold tags around the WPML screen name; "Options page" is ACF's own name for that screen. Verb, imperative.
#: classes/Options/EditorHooks.php:502
msgid "Translate this Options page from the <b>Translation Dashboard</b>"
msgstr "Vertaal deze optiepagina vanuit het <b>Vertaalbeheer</b>"

#. translators: Text in the notice on an ACF options page in a secondary language. %1$s: opening link tag, %2$s: closing link tag; the link opens WPML's Translation Dashboard.
#: classes/Options/EditorHooks.php:505
#, php-format
msgid "You no longer need to switch the admin language to translate options manually. Translate all your options from the %1$sTranslation Dashboard%2$s."
msgstr "U hoeft de admin-taal niet langer te wisselen om opties handmatig te vertalen. Vertaal al uw opties vanuit het %1$sVertaalbeheer%2$s."

#. translators: Tooltip of the link in that notice; it opens WPML's Translation Dashboard.
#: classes/Options/EditorHooks.php:507
msgid "Go to the Translation Dashboard"
msgstr "Ga naar het vertaalbeheer"

#. translators: Text in the notice on an ACF options page in a secondary language. %1$s: opening link tag, %2$s: closing link tag; the link opens WPML's Translation Jobs list. "Edit Translation" is the tooltip of the pencil icon in that list: use the same words as WPML's own translation of that tooltip.
#: classes/Options/EditorHooks.php:512
#, php-format
msgid "To change a finished translation, go to %1$sTranslation Jobs%2$s and click on the Edit Translation icon."
msgstr "Om een voltooide vertaling te wijzigen, gaat u naar %1$sVertaaltaken%2$s en klikt u op het pictogram Vertaling bewerken."

#. translators: Tooltip of the link in that notice; it opens WPML's Translation Jobs list.
#: classes/Options/EditorHooks.php:514
msgid "Go to Translation Jobs"
msgstr "Ga naar vertaaltaken"

#. translators: 1: number of fields the form sent, 2: the max_input_vars limit
#: classes/Post/MaxInputVarsGuard.php:43
#, php-format
msgid "WPML blocked this save to prevent data loss. The form sent about %1$s fields, but the PHP max_input_vars limit on this server (%2$s) let fewer through. Saving now would permanently delete the fields that did not arrive, including repeater rows. Nothing was saved. Ask your host to raise max_input_vars above %1$s and save again."
msgstr "WPML heeft deze opslag geblokkeerd om gegevensverlies te voorkomen. Het formulier verzond ongeveer %1$s velden, maar de PHP max_input_vars limiet op deze server liet er slechts (%2$s) door. Nu opslaan zou de velden die niet zijn aangekomen permanent verwijderen, inclusief repeater-rijen. Er is niets opgeslagen. Vraag uw host om max_input_vars te verhogen tot boven %1$s en sla opnieuw op."

#. translators: Title of the error page shown when a field group has more fields than the server will accept in one save.
#: classes/Post/MaxInputVarsGuard.php:55
msgid "Save blocked to prevent data loss"
msgstr "Opslaan geblokkeerd om gegevensverlies te voorkomen"

